    "Declarative pipeline manifest (PIPELINE_DESIGN.md principle 5).",
    "Replaces the glob-sweeps + duplicated run_* functions across",
    "daily/hourly/weekly_refresh.sh. run_stage.py executes matching steps.",
    "Each step: name, script (rel to agents/etl), stage, cadence, timeout(s),",
    "enabled, optional args. Order within a (cadence,stage) = execution order.",
    "Deduped vs the old shells: market builders + crypto_normalize +",
    "market_overview each appear ONCE (resolves OPERATOR_NOTES flag 2).",
    "The IBKR EC2 ssh runner is NOT here \u2014 it is not a python/sql script;",
    "the shell wrapper keeps it. cadence 'weekly' replaces the",
    "'# CADENCE: weekly' comment-marker hack."
  ],
